    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart Factory – Experience It Online, Too </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">If the trip to Pleidelsheim is too far, you should still be able to experience the ZOLLER system firsthand. The one-on-one expert consultation offers you the option to schedule a personalized online appointment with our specialists. Using state-of-the-art media technology, we’ll bring the solutions from the Smart Factory right to you. We look forward to your appointment request. </p> <p class=\"large-text\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule an appointment now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/e/csm_smart_factory_01_55291fa71a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 1080
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c59555",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Theory and Practice in One Place: Smart Factory and Academy </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">In addition to live production operations, the ZOLLER Smart Factory houses the technical and generously equipped ZOLLER Academy in the same building. There, we regularly host training sessions and invite attendees to events covering current topics in tooling and manufacturing, as well as the ZOLLER product portfolio. </p> <p class=\"large-text\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/events\">View Events</a></p> <p class=\"large-text\">Typical ZOLLER—everything from a single source.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/8/csm_smart_factory_02_4ea9e63266.webp",
     "alt": "",
